          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koany Esau ebe elipaki Isaak Yakob arereŋ, kijuka da ŋes alosit PadanAram aimany kaŋina aberu; ido ilipakini arereŋ abu kicorak ebe, “Sirikimany aberu naka apesur nukoKanaan”; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
