            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kolot Esau mama ejai Isimael, komany Makalat akoku naka Isimael okoku loka Aburaam, kinac naka Nebaiot araun akeberu, nepepe kanor nukejaas kaŋes,",
          "type": "text",
