              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ido koany, ebwoi EJAKAIT kokuiuke, kobala ebe, “Eoŋ EJAKAIT, Edeke loka Aburaam papaakon, ido Edeke loka Isaak: akwap naiperio, kainakini jo, nepepe kakoniwur; ",
